{
  "schema": "XADB_MODULE_GATE_RECORD_V1",
  "change": "DEV3 Row DELETE first path, stage 2a (format layer, dev3-row-delete.md): scope3 opcodes DeleteForward=8/DeleteClr=9/DeletePrune=23 with shapes, frames (largest Row frame 95888 B) and per-opcode wire native sides; Job3 effect byte @284 with the Forward/CLR/cleanup recipes in one place (job.rs) used by the ledger, A's INSERT producer and Reserve; undo codec accepts a bodyless Releasing RowValue. No product entry writes a DELETE root or frame. C's shared prepare rules (producer, whole-group observer and replay) refuse a DELETE root at the selected Job decode, A's INSERT producer and base4 refuse effect 1, Row replay refuses 8/9/23, and the N1 jobs observer refuses it too; all Unsupported until stage 2b. Contract text for the new maxima and the Job effect byte. Tests RDL-F01..F07, F09 and the boundary guards. Moved to stage 2b: the codec entries (a) schema and (b) metadata with RDL-F08 (they have no caller in 2a, and changing validate_record or public signatures would move the pinned census models: catalog_before source_census, transition ur_*, transition/source.rs undo_row_codec under the C Row lifecycle 40,881/44,304); a case for base4's effect-1 refusal (needs a resealed effect-1 base, which RDL-R builds); replay of 8/9/23 (RDL-R).",
