      "reason": "Row replay refuses opcodes 8/9/23 at ordinal selection, with an unreachable arm in the change match guarded by that early return. For a well-formed 8/9/23 frame replay returns the same value as before this change, sem(Unsupported): before, Operation::decode inside decode_layout returned it; now ordinal selection does. Only malformed 8/9/23 frames change error kind, and that is the decoder's, covered by RDL-F04 at decode_layout. No producer writes these frames in this change; their replay with its observer and tests (RDL-R) is stage 2b. The INSERT arms are unchanged; the match only gained the three new variants."
